# --- Free selections --------------------------------------------------------
# The free selection of every free provider at 01:10Z, as the collector
# projects it from the routing snapshot: the model the provider selected for
# the free tier, the basis of its capacity, the share of its window that is
# left, the pace and the reset. The live set is nineteen providers, eleven
# with a model. A provider with no free winner keeps its row with basis
# "none": the collector publishes it for the cards' free-models line, and the
# Providers page leaves it out of the Free group.
#
# The free routes a provider holds apart from its paid allowance are counted
# by state. A provider that holds no free route publishes no count at all, so
# its card carries no free line.
#
# OpenCode Go is the case the page needs both of: its monthly allowance is
# spent, and its Beam Free route is free and available.
