# --- Provider capacity ------------------------------------------------------
# The account windows of the live set: twelve accounts hold twenty-two windows
# between them, two of the windows were inferred from a limit failure (one of
# them rolls), and seventeen accounts publish no window of their own yet, so
# they are learning. The set is the live set with the headroom of the next
# collection, so the height of the panel is sized for the cards it will hold.
#
# The labels carry the scope of the window, as the collector publishes it
# since the account record keeps the scope of the ranking: 'Session · Claude &
# GPT', 'Weekly · Claude & GPT', 'Quota · Gemini' and 'Weekly · Fable'. The
# Antigravity account holds four rows.
#
# The values are read at 2026-10-22T21:01:17Z, the moment the worked cases
# are computed from. A window that publishes no reset of its own says so by
# publishing none: the weekly window of Ollama, the quota windows of
# Antigravity and the inferred window of Example Free are four of them. The
# check time is the moment the provider reported the window, and the age of a
# card is read from the oldest window it holds.
